---@field ClusterType? aws.redshift.String The type of the cluster. When cluster type is specified as
---@field NodeType aws.redshift.String The node type to be provisioned for the cluster. For information about node types, go to Working with Clusters in the Amazon Redshift Cluster Management Guide.
---@field MasterUsername aws.redshift.String The user name associated with the admin user account for the cluster that is being created.
